      "options": {
        "content": "**Lead untrusted-code story with gVisor / Firecracker.** Isolate currently runs jail-off in itest scenarios \u2014 **do not claim isolate containment**. gVisor synthetic-kernel is a *signal*; pair with capability-drop evidence (UC-98).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
